{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Track the app’s installs, updates, opens, moves to the background and terminations, and make the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s records durable as the app leaves the foreground."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"title":"LifecycleTracking","symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","externalID":"LifecycleTracking","modules":[{"name":"LifecycleTracking"}],"roleHeading":"Framework"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this module to track the application’s lifecycle on any platform. Nothing is tracked until"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the app calls "},{"code":"trackLifecycle","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on its tracker as it launches, and keeps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/LifecycleObservation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" it returns; tracking stops when that is cancelled, finished or released."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For the screens and controls inside the app, see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/automatictracking","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As it starts, it compares the app’s version (","type":"text"},{"code":"CFBundleShortVersionString","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" by default, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"version:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") with the one its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/LifecycleTracking\/documentation\/LifecycleTracking\/VersionStore","type":"reference"},{"text":" saved at the last launch. No saved version tra